  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till NSSC utbildning str&#xE5;ls&#xE4;kerhet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to education in radiation protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att vidareutveckla kunskapsbasen vid Nuclear Security Support Center (NSSC), som etablerades med st&#xF6;d fr&#xE5;n SSM 2014 vid Chisinau Technical University. St&#xF6;d till utbildning i fr&#xE5;gor om str&#xE5;ls&#xE4;kerhet och icke-spridning i Moldavien, samt olaglig handel med nukle&#xE4;rt och radioaktivt material.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to further develop the knowledge base at the Nuclear Security Support Center (NSSC), which was established with support from SSM in 2014 at the Chisinau Technical University. Support for training on radiation safety and non-proliferation issues in Moldova, as well illicit trafficking in nuclear and radioactive materials.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased knowledge in nuclear nonproliferation issues</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xD6;kad kunskap i s&#xE4;kerhets-och icke-spridnings fr&#xE5;gor</narrative>
  </description>
